WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:02.800
what? For our store entity, the

00:00:02.679 --> 00:00:04.220
properties might include the region

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:05.900
it belongs to, its square footage,

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.080
or its priority classification for

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:08.760
the supply chain.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:10.200
And then we have to connect

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.040
them. That brings us to relationships.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.979
Relationships define the verbs between

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:16.680
the nouns. They explain how different

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.620
entity types interact in the real

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:19.880
world. Give me an example.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.940
You might define a relationship that

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:24.880
states a store operates a refrigeration

00:00:24.759 --> 00:00:27.780
unit or a supplier ships a

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.280
product. You are drawing explicit lines

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.780
of meaning so the AI doesn't

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:32.980
have to guess how a supplier

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:33.879
and a store are connected.
